<Project>

  <!--
    Previously suppressed the NuGet audit warning for CVE-2025-6965 (GHSA-2m69-gcr7-jv3q) against
    SQLitePCLRaw.lib.e_sqlite3 (SQLite < 3.50.2), a transitive dependency of Microsoft.Data.Sqlite.
    The Microsoft.Data.Sqlite 10.x update pulls in SQLitePCLRaw 2.1.12, which bundles a patched
    SQLite (>= 3.50.2); the advisory no longer applies, so the suppression was removed. This file is
    intentionally kept as a home for future solution-wide build properties.
  -->

